## Closeout Checklist

- [ ] Repo docs updated.
- [ ] Existing OB task checked before creating a new one.
- [ ] Task status/category/priority/parent project verified.
- [ ] Delivery links added.
- [ ] Daily log or journal linked.
- [ ] Sync command returned machine-readable output.
- [ ] Result URL/path reported to user.
